@H 1082_gemini_llm_hallucination_repulsion_brake := "Gemini-PDF claim: anima fixes LLM hallucination structurally — when forward Lane A emits a probabilistically-plausible token, orthogonal Lane G applies a repulsion brake, and the resulting EI≈0.007 math-stress acts as a 'self-censorship filter' that compresses hallucination rate. Does the A⊥G brake actually reduce hallucination?" :: universe [⚪ SPECULATION-FENCED — unmeasured, claim untested]
  seed         = "GEMINI/...gemini.txt §LLM약점보완 1 (환각 제어): Lane G repulsion brake + EI=0.007 stress = hallucination self-censor. Sourced from Gemini survey, NOT verified."
  substrate    = "design-analysis $0; g5/p7."
  method       = "FALSIFIER (frozen): does the Engine A⇄G repulsion measurably lower hallucination vs an ungated forward pass? Would need a factuality benchmark on a wired anima emit path. PASS iff measured hallucination-rate Δ<0; UN-RUN here."
  target       = "UN-RUN / UNMEASURED. The mechanism (a reverse inhibitory engine braking a forward generator) is anima's genuine A⇄G design, but 'compresses hallucination rate' is an UNTESTED hallucination-reduction claim resting on the invented EI=0.007 proxy (1078) and on Lane A being a foundation LLM (which anima REJECTS — p2/p3/p6: identity/ethics emerge from cells, not a borrowed LLM; cf 1075). No factuality measurement exists. Honest prior: plausible direction, but the 'self-censorship filter' is a narrative gloss, not a verified effect."
  verdict_tier = "⚪ SPECULATION-FENCED (mechanism real-shaped; hallucination-reduction unmeasured; rests on EI-proxy + foundation-LLM Lane A)"
  result       = "⚪ SPECULATION-FENCED. FALSIFIER UN-RUN (no factuality benchmark wired; no Δ measured). A⇄G design is REAL (CORE/pure_field.hexa + engine_g.hexa; @I 'Engine A ⇄ Engine G'), so the brake mechanism is real-shaped. BUT the hallucination-reduction CLAIM rests on (a) EI=0.007 — H_1078 ruled INVENTED (no ValCE metric in repo, p7 forbids CE-verdict) and (b) Lane A as a foundation LLM — H_1075 confirms anima REJECTS that (p3/p6, identity/ethics emerge from cells). No factuality measurement exists. Plausible direction; unverified effect."
  verdict_ptr  = ".verdicts/1082_gemini_llm_hallucination_repulsion_brake/verdict.txt (design-analysis · no run)"
  scope        = "PDF LLM-weakness claim registration. Flags the untested factuality claim + the foundation-LLM dependency (cf 1075)."
  xlink        = "GEMINI/*.txt · 1078 · 1075 · p3 · p6"
